  <title>Faraday's Law</title>
	<introduction>
    <p> In this chapter you will learn about Faraday's Law.</p>
	
	</introduction>
		
    <objectives>
      
      <introduction><p>After successful completion of this chapter, you will be able to:</p></introduction>
		<ol>
			<li><p>Use Faraday's Law to find the induced voltage due to changing magnetic fields.</p></li>
			<li><p>Describe the behavior of simple LC and LR circuits qualitatively and quantitatively.</p></li>
		</ol>
	</objectives>

